//cybersecurityunitn.github.io/necs-winterschool/speakers/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;To be announced soon.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Venue</title><link>https://cybersecurityunitn.github.io/necs-winterschool/venue/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cybersecurityunitn.github.io/necs-winterschool/venue/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The NeCS PhD Winter School 2027 will take place at &lt;a href="https://fiemme.hotelbellavista.eu/"&gt;Hotel Bellavista&lt;/a&gt; from 1 to 8 February 2027 in Cavalese, Trento, Italy.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-board accommodation is included in the registration fee.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Cavalese is a charming alpine town in Trentino and the historic centre of Val di Fiemme. Surrounded by the Dolomites and the Lagorai mountain range, it combines spectacular mountain scenery, a lively historic centre, local traditions and excellent cuisine. In winter, the area is renowned for skiing, cross-country skiing and snow activities.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>